hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"994","[AI-translation] Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Na Musalman kafir ka waris banta hai aur na kafir Musalman ka waris banta hai. (Muslim: 5/59). Baab: Farayez ko un ke haqdaaron tak pahunchao."
"995","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hissa daaron ko un ke hissay de do. Phir jo bachay wo us shakhs ka hai jo sab se zyada mayyat se nazdeek ho. (Muslim: 5/59). Baab: Kalala ki miraas. (Farayez muqarrar hissay hain; falaula se murad aqrab hai.)"
"996","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas aaye aur main beemar aur behosh tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wuzu kiya to logon ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke wuzu ka pani mujh par daala to mujhe hosh aa gaya. Main ne arz ki ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mera tarka? Tarka to kalala ka ho ga. Shuba kehtay hain ke main ne Muhammad bin Munkadir se poocha ke kya ye aayat: Fatwa poochtay hain tujh se, keh de Allah fatwa deta hai tum ko masala kalala mein, Surah Nisa: 176, naazil hui thi? Unhon ne kaha: Haan! Yehi aayat naazil hui thi. (Muslim: 5/60). (Kalala wo hai ke aadmi mar jaye aur na walid chhoray na aulad jo waris hon.)"
"997","[AI-translation] Madan bin Abu Talha se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Juma ke din khutba diya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka zikr kiya aur Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ka zikr kiya. Phir kaha ke main apne baad koi aisa ahem masala nahi chhorta jaisay kalala ka masala hai aur main ne aisa masala baar baar nahi poocha jitna kalala ka aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bhi mujh se aisi sakhti kisi baat mein nahi ki jitni kalala ke masalay mein ki, yahan tak ke apni ungli mubarak mere seenay mein chubho kar farmaya: Ae Umar! Tujh ko wo aayat kaafi nahi hai jo garmi ke mausam mein Surah Nisa ke aakhir mein utri thi. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar main zinda raha to kalala ke baaray mein aisa hukm saaf saaf dun ga ke us ke muwafiq har shakhs faisla karay jo Quran padhta hai aur jo nahi padhta. (Muslim: 5/61). (Nawawi ne kaha: Usay aayat-us-saif is liye kaha ke wo garmi mein naazil hui.)"
"998","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib se riwayat hai ke aakhri soorat jo poori utri wo Surah Tauba hai aur aakhri aayat jo utri wo kalala ki aayat hai. (Muslim: 5/61). Baab: Jo maal chhor jaye to us ke warison ke liye hai."
"999","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aisay shakhs ka janaza laya jata tha jis par qarz hota to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) poochtay: Kya us ne itna maal chhora hai jo us ke qarz ko kaafi ho? Agar log kehtay ke haan chhora hai to namaz padhtay aur nahi to logon se farma detay ke tum apne saathi par namaz padh lo. Phir jab Allah Taala ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par fatoohat ka darwaza khol diya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main mominon ka khud un ki jaanon se zyada nazdeek hun. Ab jo koi qarzdaar maray to qarz ka ada karna mere zimmay hai aur jo koi maal chhor kar maray to wo us ke warison ka hai. (Muslim: 5/62)"
